    sub_sup_line_box_strut_contradiction_2026-09-14, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep-20261127 (only-shifted lines now grow the line box by content-level reach past the strut, not the shifted box full half-leading, matching Chrome 152/159); sub_sup_only_line_box_strut_spec 9/9 PASS 2026-11-27. Was: <sub>/<sup> line box is the inline's own height", and the obvious strut fix contradicts Chrome (2026-09-14)", doc/08_tracking/bug/sub_sup_line_box_strut_contradiction_2026-09-14.md, 1, doc/08_tracking/bug/sub_sup_line_box_strut_contradiction_2026-09-14.md, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true

